message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "From Refining Capacity to Import Dependence: Reproducible Evidence on Portugal's Diesel and Gasoline Market, 1990-2024"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ribeiro"
    given-names: "Diogo"
    affiliation: "School of Media Arts and Design, Polytechnic of Porto"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-2022-7072"
version: "0.5.0"
date-released: "2026-08-22"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/DiogoRibeiro7/portugal-refining-resilience"
abstract: "Reproducible research software, derived evidence tables, figures, provenance records, and final report for an empirical analysis of Portugal's diesel and motor-gasoline balance from 1990 to 2024, covering refinery-output coverage, import dependence, structural breaks, monthly event timing, Portugal-Spain comparisons, and retail pre-tax price co-movement."
keywords:
  - Portugal
  - refining capacity
  - petroleum products
  - import dependence
  - energy economics
  - price co-movement
  - reproducible research
